OL,3,GNEWSAI will never be the man I was,
OL,4,Asays Manchester Arena survivor at
OL,5,Aceremony for victims of terror
OL,6,
OL,7,FPaul Price, a survivor of the 2017
OL,8,FManchester Arena attack, says "I will
OL,9,Fnever be the man I was", adding that
OL,10,Fpart of him died along with his
OL,11,Fpartner, Elaine
OL,13,FWhile taking place in London, the
OL,14,Fceremony is being broadcast live at a
OL,15,Fchurch in Lockerbie - the site of the
OL,16,Fdeadliest terror attack on UK soil,
OL,17,Fwrites our reporter in Scotland
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
